---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Logo from '../../components/Logo.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service | MFD Research';
const description =
  'Terms for using mfdresearch.com, the website of MFD Research Group LLC: informational content, no consulting relationship without a written agreement, and California governing law.';
const canonical = 'https://mfdresearch.com/terms-of-service/';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <main class="legal-page wrap">
    <a class="legal-top" href="/" aria-label="MFD Research home">
      <Logo />
    </a>

    <article class="legal-card">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="meta">Last updated: September 28, 2026</p>

      <p>
        These Terms of Service (“Terms”) apply to your use of <a href="https://mfdresearch.com/">mfdresearch.com</a>
        (the “website”), operated by MFD Research Group LLC (“MFD Research,” “we,” “us”). By using the website, you
        agree to these Terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the website.
      </p>

      <h2>Using the Website</h2>
      <p>You may use the website for lawful business and informational purposes. You agree not to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>attempt to gain unauthorized access to the website or the systems behind it;</li>
        <li>disrupt or overload the website, including through automated scraping;</li>
        <li>use the contact form to send spam, malware or unlawful content; or</li>
        <li>impersonate anyone or misrepresent your affiliation with any organization.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Information Only, Not Professional Advice</h2>
      <p>
        Content on this website is general information about clinical research operations and our services. It is
        not medical, legal, regulatory or compliance advice, and it is not tailored to your study, site or
        organization. Don't rely on it for decisions about patient care, study conduct or regulatory submissions
        without advice from a qualified professional who knows your circumstances.
      </p>

      <h2>No Consulting Relationship</h2>
      <p>
        Contacting us, submitting the form or booking a consultation does not create a consulting, advisory or other
        professional relationship. We provide services only under a separate written agreement signed by both
        parties. If that agreement conflicts with these Terms, the agreement controls.
      </p>

      <h2>Confidentiality of Inquiries</h2>
      <p>
        Please don't send confidential or proprietary information, protected health information, or patient or
        study-participant data through the website or in an initial email. Information you send before a
        confidentiality agreement is in place is not treated as confidential. We still handle it as described in our
        <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>. When an engagement needs confidential information, we will put
        a confidentiality agreement in place first.
      </p>

      <h2>Scheduling</h2>
      <p>
        Consultations are booked through a Google Calendar booking page, which is also subject to Google's terms.
        Booking a time doesn't guarantee availability, and we may need to reschedule.
      </p>

      <h2>Experience, Engagements and Credentials</h2>
      <p>
        Descriptions of past experience, engagements and outcomes show the kind of work we do. Results depend on each
        study's circumstances and are not a promise of future results. Mentions of conferences, organizations or
        publications do not mean they endorse MFD Research.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        The website and its content, including text, graphics and layout, and the MFD Research name and logo, are
        owned by or licensed to MFD Research Group LLC. You may view and print pages for your own informational or
        internal business use. You may not copy, modify, republish or use them commercially, or use our name or logo,
        without our written permission. Other names and trademarks on the website belong to their owners.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>
        The website links to third-party websites, such as LinkedIn, conference sites and our booking page. We don't
        control them and are not responsible for their content, privacy practices or availability.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        The website is provided “as is” and “as available.” To the fullest extent permitted by law, we disclaim all
        warranties, express or implied, including warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose,
        accuracy and non-infringement. We don't guarantee that the website will be uninterrupted, error-free or
        up to date.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, MFD Research Group LLC and its members, employees and contractors are
        not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential or punitive damages, or for lost profits, data
        or business, arising from your use of, or inability to use, the website. Nothing in these Terms limits
        liability that cannot be limited under applicable law. This section does not apply to services provided under
        a separate written agreement, which sets its own terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Indemnification</h2>
      <p>
        You agree to indemnify and hold MFD Research Group LLC harmless from claims, losses and expenses, including
        reasonable attorneys' fees, arising from your misuse of the website or your violation of these Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of California, without regard to its conflict-of-law
        rules.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms from time to time. We will post the new version on this page and update the date at
        the top. Changes apply from the date they are posted. If you continue to use the website after that, you
        accept the updated Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>General</h2>
      <p>
        If any part of these Terms is found unenforceable, the rest remains in effect. Our not enforcing a provision
        is not a waiver of it. These Terms and our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> are the entire
        agreement between you and us about the website. Services are governed by their own written agreement.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        MFD Research Group LLC<br />
        <a href="mailto:info@mfdresearch.com">info@mfdresearch.com</a>
      </p>

      <a class="home-btn" href="/">Back to Home</a>
    </article>
  </main>

</BaseLayout>
